OL,3,GNEWSACompanies exploiting welfare
OL,4,Asystem by using residents as 'cash
OL,5,Acows', BBC finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome private companies are making huge
OL,8,Fprofits and exploiting the welfare
OL,9,Fsystem by receiving housing benefits on
OL,10,Fbehalf of residents but failing to give
OL,11,Fthem the support they are required to,
OL,12,FBBC Panorama has found.
OL,14,FProperty agents are drawing people into
OL,15,Fthe taxpayer-funded system using social
OL,16,Fmedia videos that offer free rooms,
OL,17,FPlayStation consoles and even holidays.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
